#. Tag: title
#: commands.docbook:2
#, no-c-format
msgid "Command Reference"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: title
#: commands.docbook:5
#, no-c-format
msgid "The main &kpercentage; window"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: commands.docbook:7
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"In the main window you can only enter one of the three input boxes. Here you "
"have to type in your guess. Press <keycap>Enter</keycap> or click the "
"<guibutton>Apply</guibutton> Button, to see if you are right."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: commands.docbook:13
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<screeninfo>Here's a screenshot of the &kpercentage; main window</screeninfo>"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: phrase
#: commands.docbook:19
#, no-c-format
msgid "<phrase>Here's a screenshot of the &kpercentage; main window</phrase>"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: commands.docbook:24
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"On the bottom, two progress bars display your effort. The upper bar shows "
"the ratio of totally attempted exercises. The lower bar compares the right "
"with the wrong answers. Do you notice that this is a percentage task too? "
"Mistyped inputs (letters, spaces, and so on) have no influence here."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: commands.docbook:30
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"At any time you can leave this window with the <guibutton>Cancel</guibutton> "
"button. You will be carried back to the welcome window. There you can select "
"another type of task or exit &kpercentage;."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: commands.docbook:35
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If you press the <guibutton>Apply</guibutton> button you are told whether "
"your input was right or wrong..."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: commands.docbook:39
#, no-c-format
msgid "<screeninfo>Information about correct input</screeninfo>"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: phrase
#: commands.docbook:45
#, no-c-format
msgid "<phrase>Information about correct input</phrase>"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: commands.docbook:50
#, no-c-format
msgid "The funny smiley jumping up and down for every right task you made!"
msgstr ""
